  "description": "A young baron's daughter discovers a strangely shaped wooden object beneath her older sister's bed and learns that every proper lady should own a dildo. Confidently heading to a sculpture workshop, she soon faces two problems: she has no idea how the object is actually used, and she can't stop thinking about the incredibly handsome sculptor who owns the workshop.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285002995)",
